{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2040,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was in the Lofoten Islands in northern Norway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5800,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I came across one of the strangest sights I have ever seen:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10040,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cod.\n[♫ ominous low tone fades in ♪]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11400,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hundreds of thousands of them, strung up on racks,\n[♫ ominous low tone fades in ♪]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15240,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their stench blanketing entire villages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20280,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This annual massacre has been going on for over a thousand years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26160,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it may be the very reason the Vikings existed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34060,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "♫"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36200,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The poles of our planet are hostile to life, especially human life, in the time before modern comforts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42840,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not only are the winters long and cold,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46120,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are also dark. And that is important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51000,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As humans migrated north across Europe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54160,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a strange illness emerged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56640,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It especially affected children:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58760,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their bones grew soft and deformed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61920,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some died, others were painfully disfigured for life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67360,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The condition became known as \"rickets\" in children and \"osteomalacia\" in adults."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73320,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From studies of bones, we know it was prevalent as early as the Roman Empire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78040,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but likely much earlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80440,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And doctors were powerless to cure the disease because no one knew what caused it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87640,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientific evidence only came to light in the early 1920s during an experiment in Vienna."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93400,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was discovered that children with rickets recovered miraculously"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97680,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after they were regularly allowed to play outside on a balcony."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102080,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientists realized without fully understanding why,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106200,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sunlight is essential for the development of healthy human bones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114480,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we understand what's happening is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117040,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ultraviolet light from the Sun strikes cholesterol molecules just under the surface of our skin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122800,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it activates them to become vitamin D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126640,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This vitamin D is essential for absorbing the calcium necessary to form strong, healthy bones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132640,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But north of 42 degrees latitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135400,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there isn't enough sun in the winter months to form 𝘢𝘯𝘺 vitamin D,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140080,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hence the epidemic of rickets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143380,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The notable exception here is the Vikings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147280,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They occupied what is now Denmark, Norway, and Sweden"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well north of the 42nd parallel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153120,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet they had a reputation for being an imposing fighting force."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157520,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over 1,200 years ago, they raided towns all along the coasts of Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163240,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They laid siege to Paris!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166680,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Vikings were intrepid sailors, voyaging out across the seas, establishing colonies in Iceland and Greenland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174440,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They even reached North America, the first Europeans to do so, 500 years before Christopher Columbus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180920,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why weren't they overcome by the debilitating illness of rickets?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well because although Scandinavia is cursed with a lack of sunlight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cure is swimming just offshore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193000,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right -- cod."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196020,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "♫"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206560,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ungh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209080,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is one big fish!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211120,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This fish was an essential food source but even more than that, it was a source of vitamin D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the oily flesh and particularly in the fish's liver."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223180,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a big cod liver."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228200,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just one meal of cod with liver and eggs supplies enough vitamin D to last you a month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234320,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And your body can store it because vitamin D is fat soluble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238720,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To survive the dark winter months, and to build strong healthy bones in children, cod was essential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248840,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So were the Vikings just lucky?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251080,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, they lived in a part of the world that is virtually uninhabitable due to its lack of sunlight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256760,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if not for the cod."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260240,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Without cod, there likely never would have been a large thriving population of warriors in northern Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is cod the only reason we still know about the Vikings?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did cod, in a sense, create the Vikings?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275000,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well I think it's more complicated than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277920,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Vikings figured out how to use the cod to promote better health."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282360,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One practice they passed down from generation to generation was extracting oil from the cod's livers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The part of the cod that is richest in vitamin D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302400,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, was this science?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I think it's tempting to think the Vikings figured out something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307780,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that remained a mystery to modern medicine for over a millennium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312160,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think it probably went something like this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315640,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe some people noticed that cod liver oil drinkers were healthier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319920,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or their children taller, sturdier than those living further inland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324200,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the cultural practice of drinking cod liver oil spread,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327680,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like evolution, but for ideas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330280,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Humans living together observing one another and emulating what works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334800,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a kind of proto-science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337280,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like running numerous uncontrolled experiments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340720,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but carried out over a whole population for generations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344160,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of what comes out of that is likely to have a basis in truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350360,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the culture served as the memory of the population of people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356200,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is essential because life is complicated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358840,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are so many different things in nature and so many interactions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362680,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that to have to encounter each one anew\nwould be chaotic and overwhelming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368240,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are able to function in the world because of the knowledge handed down to us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373160,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both explicitly, but also implicitly by way of our culture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380280,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tradition can be a way of encoding knowledge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383400,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a way for us to build on those who came before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386600,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially in a time before systematic teaching or books."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391240,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Vikings clearly understood that cod and cod liver oil were beneficial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395760,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not exactly how beneficial or why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399800,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the Greenland Viking settlement, that cultural knowledge was apparently forgotten:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405360,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There, the Viking settlers turned to farming as their main source of subsistence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410520,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and without as much cod in their diets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413000,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lack of vitamin D was crippling -- literally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417120,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exhumed bones revealed that among genetic deformities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420400,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are the tell-tale signs of rickets:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423360,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spine curvature, deformation of arms and legs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426680,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and narrowed pelvis and overall bone deformation and fractures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431400,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Greenland colony vanished about 500 years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435320,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and vitamin D deficiency was one of the likely causes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443680,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the Vikings had a scientific understanding of how important cod and cod liver oil was to their survival,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449920,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they never would have stopped taking it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452600,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the absence of science, traditional knowledge is often the best place to start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456880,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, cod liver oil was actually the substance in which the first vitamin was scientifically identified:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462400,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "vitamin A. And later the fourth, vitamin D"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467600,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But cultural knowledge is also 𝘯𝘰𝘵 science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470360,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are harmful practices like bloodletting mixed in with the helpful ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474600,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And without knowledge of clear cause-and-effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477060,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the importance of some practices, like taking the cod liver oil, can be forgotten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481840,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the British who realized, through the first known randomized control trial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487000,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that citrus fruits cure scurvy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490320,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result it was their fleet, rather than say the Vikings, that came to dominate the seas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496280,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "♫"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500920,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would argue that the scientific method is the greatest technology humans have ever developed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505800,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It allows us to understand not only what works but why it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511120,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that knowledge, our future is determined not by luck,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515520,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but by our ability to manipulate reality to our advantage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525080,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was made with excerpts from my feature-length documentary, Vitamania."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529360,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to watch it for a couple bucks, click this link to find out how."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533360,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to say a huge thank-you to our funding partners and to gene pool productions with whom I made this film."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539280,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vitamania, it's all about the sense and nonsense of vitamins."
    } ]
  } ]
}
